@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "空闲（Idle）\nrunning = false\narmed = false" as Idle
state "已就绪（Armed）\nrunning = false\narmed = true" as Armed
state "运行（Running）\nrunning = true\nvalve、pump ON" as Running

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Armed : 健康的 START 已松开\n且健康的 STOP 允许运行
Idle --> Idle : START 被按住、STOP 不允许运行\n或任一输入故障
Armed --> Running : 健康的 START 被按下\n且 STOP 允许运行
Armed --> Idle : STOP 不允许运行\n或任一输入故障
Running --> Running : STOP 允许运行\n（START 故障时保持运行）
Running --> Idle : STOP 不允许运行\n或 STOP 故障
@enduml
